# Images are built with the repository root as context (they need libs/telemetry-contracts).
# Keep everything else out so builds are fast and no local secrets or data end up in an image.
.git
.env
*.pdf
**/.venv
**/venv
**/target
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
simulator/data
bench/results
docs
ml
.idea
.vscode
